[
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.4,
"text": "You are standing in a river at dusk,"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 2.4,
"t1": 4.31,
"text": "20 meters away, two small"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 4.31,
"t1": 6.24,
"text": "bumps sit on the water."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 6.24,
"t1": 7.89,
"text": "They are eyes. They"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 7.89,
"t1": 9.58,
"text": "belong to the largest reptile on"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 9.58,
"t1": 11.33,
"text": "Earth. It has the strongest"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 11.33,
"t1": 13.13,
"text": "bite ever measured, and"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 13.13,
"t1": 15.13,
"text": "it saw you first. So"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 15.13,
"t1": 16.82,
"text": "what happens next? How"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 16.82,
"t1": 18.42,
"text": "did it find you? What will"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 18.42,
"t1": 20.11,
"text": "it do? And what is the one"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 20.11,
"t1": 21.89,
"text": "thing every survivor did to"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 21.89,
"t1": 23.33,
"text": "get out alive?"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.69,
"text": "This is the saltwater crocodile,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 2.69,
"t1": 5.0,
"text": "the largest reptile alive."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 5.0,
"t1": 7.02,
"text": "A big male is four to five meters"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 7.02,
"t1": 9.75,
"text": "long, longer than most cars."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 9.75,
"t1": 11.75,
"text": "He weighs around half a ton."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 11.75,
"t1": 13.47,
"text": "Some weigh twice that."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 13.47,
"t1": 15.64,
"text": "The biggest ever held in captivity"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 15.64,
"t1": 17.38,
"text": "was called Lolong. He was"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 17.38,
"t1": 19.13,
"text": "caught in the Philippines in two thousand"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 19.13,
"t1": 20.96,
"text": "and eleven. Six"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 20.96,
"t1": 23.13,
"text": "point one seven meters long, one"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 23.13,
"t1": 25.85,
"text": "thousand and seventy-five kilograms."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 25.85,
"t1": 28.45,
"text": "That is a predator as long as a minibus,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 28.45,
"t1": 30.24,
"text": "heavier than a horse, and able"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 30.24,
"t1": 31.93,
"text": "to hide in water that barely"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 31.93,
"t1": 33.69,
"text": "covers your knees. And"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 33.69,
"t1": 35.55,
"text": "his design has hardly changed since"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 35.55,
"t1": 36.73,
"text": "the dinosaurs"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.31,
"text": "And it is built to last."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 2.31,
"t1": 4.29,
"text": "Under the skin of its back lie rows"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 4.29,
"t1": 6.2,
"text": "of bony plates, living"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 6.2,
"t1": 8.47,
"text": "armor fused into the hide."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 8.47,
"t1": 10.25,
"text": "They protect it. They also"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 10.25,
"t1": 12.13,
"text": "soak up heat from the sun like"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 12.13,
"t1": 14.2,
"text": "panels. Inside, its"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 14.2,
"t1": 15.98,
"text": "stomach is one of the most acidic of"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 15.98,
"t1": 17.71,
"text": "any animal. It dissolves"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 17.71,
"t1": 19.8,
"text": "bone, horn, and shell."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 19.8,
"t1": 21.62,
"text": "It even swallows stones and keeps"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 21.62,
"t1": 23.4,
"text": "them there. They help grind"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 23.4,
"t1": 25.2,
"text": "what the acid cannot."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 25.2,
"t1": 27.36,
"text": "Nothing it eats goes to waste, and"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 27.36,
"t1": 29.2,
"text": "nothing about it is fragile."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.82,
"text": "Start with how it found"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 1.82,
"t1": 4.29,
"text": "you. Its eyes, ears,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 4.29,
"t1": 5.98,
"text": "and nostrils all sit on top"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 5.98,
"t1": 8.35,
"text": "of its head in one line."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 8.35,
"t1": 10.24,
"text": "It can see, hear, and"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 10.24,
"t1": 12.05,
"text": "breathe with almost nothing"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 12.05,
"t1": 14.22,
"text": "showing. At night, its"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 14.22,
"t1": 16.6,
"text": "eyes gather light yours cannot."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 16.6,
"t1": 18.76,
"text": "In a torch beam they glow red."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 18.76,
"t1": 21.36,
"text": "But it does not need to see you at all."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 21.36,
"t1": 23.11,
"text": "Its jaws are covered in thousands"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 23.11,
"t1": 24.87,
"text": "of tiny black dots."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 24.87,
"t1": 26.96,
"text": "Each one is a pressure sensor."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 26.96,
"t1": 28.89,
"text": "Together, they are more sensitive"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 28.89,
"t1": 30.53,
"text": "than your fingertips."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 30.53,
"t1": 32.33,
"text": "Every step you take sends a ripple"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 32.33,
"t1": 34.24,
"text": "through the water. It feels"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 34.24,
"t1": 35.98,
"text": "each one. It knows where"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 35.98,
"t1": 37.71,
"text": "you are. It knows how big"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 37.71,
"t1": 39.38,
"text": "you are. It knows which way you"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 39.38,
"t1": 40.46,
"text": "are walking."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.85,
"text": "Now it does the thing it is best"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 1.85,
"t1": 4.15,
"text": "at. It waits."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 4.15,
"t1": 6.16,
"text": "You can hold your breath for a minute, maybe"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 6.16,
"t1": 7.82,
"text": "two. It can stay under"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 7.82,
"t1": 10.31,
"text": "for ten to fifteen minutes without effort,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 10.31,
"t1": 12.8,
"text": "resting on the bottom far longer."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 12.8,
"t1": 14.73,
"text": "While it waits, its heart slows"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 14.73,
"t1": 16.62,
"text": "down to just a few beats"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 16.62,
"t1": 18.42,
"text": "a minute. It is in no"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 18.42,
"t1": 20.02,
"text": "hurry to eat either."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 20.02,
"t1": 21.91,
"text": "A large crocodile can go for months"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 21.91,
"t1": 23.76,
"text": "without a meal. So it has"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 23.76,
"t1": 25.71,
"text": "air, it has energy, it"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 25.71,
"t1": 27.73,
"text": "has time. You are the only"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 27.73,
"t1": 30.14,
"text": "one here who is running out of anything."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.8,
"text": "When it moves, it moves under"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 1.8,
"t1": 3.6,
"text": "water. No wake."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 3.6,
"t1": 5.49,
"text": "No sound. It closes"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 5.49,
"t1": 7.27,
"text": "the distance until it is one body"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 7.27,
"t1": 8.96,
"text": "length away. Then the tail"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 8.96,
"t1": 10.89,
"text": "does the work. One sweep"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 10.89,
"t1": 12.96,
"text": "and half a ton leaves the water."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 12.96,
"t1": 15.53,
"text": "It is over faster than you can step back."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 15.53,
"t1": 17.25,
"text": "This is why the official advice in"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 17.25,
"t1": 18.95,
"text": "crocodile country is always"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 18.95,
"t1": 20.71,
"text": "the same. The danger is"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 20.71,
"t1": 22.22,
"text": "not the deep water."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 22.22,
"t1": 24.0,
"text": "It is the edge, the last"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 24.0,
"t1": 25.73,
"text": "few meters of shallows and the"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 25.73,
"t1": 27.51,
"text": "bank beside them. That is"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 27.51,
"t1": 29.33,
"text": "where it hunts. That is where"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 29.33,
"t1": 30.38,
"text": "you are standing."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.36,
"text": "Then the jaws close."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 2.36,
"t1": 4.47,
"text": "In 2012, scientists"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 4.47,
"t1": 6.38,
"text": "measured the bite of every crocodile"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 6.38,
"t1": 8.16,
"text": "species on Earth. The"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 8.16,
"t1": 10.67,
"text": "saltwater crocodile won sixteen"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 10.67,
"t1": 12.98,
"text": "thousand four hundred Newtons."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 12.98,
"t1": 14.89,
"text": "It is the strongest bite ever measured"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 14.89,
"t1": 16.69,
"text": "in a living animal, more than"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 16.69,
"t1": 19.16,
"text": "ten times the force of your own."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 19.16,
"t1": 21.33,
"text": "Its teeth are not built to cut."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 21.33,
"t1": 23.05,
"text": "They are built to hold."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 23.05,
"t1": 24.82,
"text": "More than sixty of them, and when one"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 24.82,
"t1": 27.07,
"text": "breaks, another grows in."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 27.07,
"t1": 29.2,
"text": "There is one strange weakness."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 29.2,
"t1": 31.71,
"text": "The muscles that open its mouth are feeble."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 31.71,
"t1": 33.56,
"text": "A person could hold those jaws shut"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 33.56,
"t1": 35.35,
"text": "with their hands, but that"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 35.35,
"t1": 37.65,
"text": "only helps before it bites, not"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 37.65,
"t1": 38.27,
"text": "after"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.71,
"text": "It cannot chew, so it"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 1.71,
"t1": 4.0,
"text": "does something else. It grips"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 4.0,
"t1": 5.73,
"text": "and it spins, its whole"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 5.73,
"t1": 7.75,
"text": "body around and around"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 7.75,
"t1": 9.42,
"text": "in the water. This is"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 9.42,
"t1": 11.13,
"text": "the death roll. It is meant to"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 11.13,
"t1": 12.82,
"text": "pull you off your feet, drag"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 12.82,
"t1": 14.93,
"text": "you under, and drown you."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 14.93,
"t1": 16.78,
"text": "In 1985, a woman"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 16.78,
"t1": 18.65,
"text": "named Val Plumwood was paddling"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 18.65,
"t1": 20.62,
"text": "a canoe alone in Kakadu"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 20.62,
"t1": 22.62,
"text": "when a crocodile took her."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 22.62,
"t1": 24.44,
"text": "It rolled her once. She came"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 24.44,
"t1": 26.13,
"text": "up and breathed. It"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 26.13,
"t1": 27.85,
"text": "rolled her again and a"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 27.85,
"t1": 29.76,
"text": "third time. Then its grip"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 29.76,
"t1": 31.64,
"text": "slipped. She dragged herself"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 31.64,
"t1": 33.31,
"text": "up a mud bank and walked"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 33.31,
"t1": 36.0,
"text": "and crawled for hours to be found."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 36.0,
"t1": 38.36,
"text": "She lived. Three death rolls,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 38.36,
"t1": 39.45,
"text": "and she lived."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.76,
"text": "And do not think it is trapped"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 1.76,
"t1": 3.6,
"text": "in this river. The name"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 3.6,
"t1": 5.62,
"text": "is a clue. This crocodile"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 5.62,
"t1": 7.49,
"text": "goes to sea. It lives"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 7.49,
"t1": 9.47,
"text": "from India, across Southeast"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 9.47,
"t1": 11.64,
"text": "Asia, to northern Australia"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 11.64,
"t1": 13.56,
"text": "and the islands beyond."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 13.56,
"t1": 15.27,
"text": "Scientists tracked one male"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 15.27,
"t1": 17.42,
"text": "by satellite. He swam"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 17.42,
"t1": 19.58,
"text": "590 kilometres in"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 19.58,
"t1": 21.35,
"text": "25 days. He"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 21.35,
"t1": 22.89,
"text": "was not swimming hard."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 22.89,
"t1": 24.93,
"text": "He was riding the ocean currents,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 24.93,
"t1": 26.6,
"text": "like a surfer waiting for the right"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 26.6,
"t1": 28.36,
"text": "wave. Glands on its"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 28.36,
"t1": 30.69,
"text": "tongue push out the extra salt."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 30.69,
"t1": 32.44,
"text": "So a beach is not safe just because"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 32.44,
"t1": 34.85,
"text": "it is a beach. In its range,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 34.85,
"t1": 36.73,
"text": "any warm coast can have one."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.2,
"text": "So could you simply run?"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 2.2,
"t1": 4.33,
"text": "You may have heard the rule: if a crocodile"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 4.33,
"t1": 6.93,
"text": "chases you, run in a zigzag."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 6.93,
"t1": 9.22,
"text": "That is a myth. On land,"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 9.22,
"t1": 11.04,
"text": "a big crocodile is quick for a few"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 11.04,
"t1": 13.24,
"text": "meters, then it is finished."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 13.24,
"t1": 15.62,
"text": "It is built to explode out of the water,"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 15.62,
"t1": 17.69,
"text": "not to chase. A healthy"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 17.69,
"t1": 19.49,
"text": "adult can outrun it, so"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 19.49,
"t1": 21.45,
"text": "do not waste steps turning."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 21.45,
"t1": 23.11,
"text": "Run straight. Run away"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 23.11,
"t1": 25.0,
"text": "from the water. Do not stop"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 25.0,
"t1": 26.93,
"text": "until you are well up the bank."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 26.93,
"t1": 28.89,
"text": "The problem was never the chase."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 28.89,
"t1": 30.64,
"text": "It is the first second, and"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 30.64,
"t1": 32.56,
"text": "in that second, it is faster"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 32.56,
"t1": 33.38,
"text": "than you."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.71,
"text": "There is a famous story"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 1.71,
"t1": 4.62,
"text": "about these animals. In 1945,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 4.62,
"t1": 6.73,
"text": "on Ramree Island, a thousand"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 6.73,
"t1": 8.56,
"text": "soldiers retreated into a mangrove"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 8.56,
"t1": 10.8,
"text": "swamp at night. By morning,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 10.8,
"t1": 12.51,
"text": "the story goes, crocodiles"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 12.51,
"t1": 14.6,
"text": "had eaten nine hundred of them."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 14.6,
"t1": 16.53,
"text": "It was once listed as the worst animal"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 16.53,
"t1": 18.44,
"text": "attack in history. But"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 18.44,
"t1": 20.2,
"text": "it comes from one man, who did"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 20.2,
"t1": 21.95,
"text": "not see it happen. No"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 21.95,
"t1": 24.07,
"text": "army record, on either side, mentions"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 24.07,
"t1": 25.75,
"text": "it. Experts doubt"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 25.75,
"t1": 27.47,
"text": "there were ever enough crocodiles in that"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 27.47,
"t1": 29.16,
"text": "swamp to do it. Most"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 29.16,
"t1": 31.44,
"text": "historians now call it a myth."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 31.44,
"t1": 33.2,
"text": "The real numbers are smaller."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 33.2,
"t1": 34.53,
"text": "And they are bad enough."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.4,
"text": "Here is what is actually recorded."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 2.4,
"t1": 4.53,
"text": "In Indonesia, in twenty twenty-four"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 4.53,
"t1": 6.22,
"text": "alone, there were one hundred"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 6.22,
"t1": 7.98,
"text": "and seventy-nine crocodile attacks"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 7.98,
"t1": 9.71,
"text": "on people. Ninety-two"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 9.71,
"t1": 11.56,
"text": "of them were fatal. That is"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 11.56,
"t1": 13.76,
"text": "one country in one year,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 13.76,
"t1": 15.44,
"text": "and researchers believe many more"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 15.44,
"t1": 17.35,
"text": "are never reported."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 17.35,
"t1": 19.47,
"text": "Many victims were not tourists."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 19.47,
"t1": 21.67,
"text": "They were people fishing, washing,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 21.67,
"t1": 23.38,
"text": "or fetching water, people"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 23.38,
"t1": 25.05,
"text": "at the edge. In Northern"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 25.05,
"t1": 26.93,
"text": "Australia, attacks are far"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 26.93,
"t1": 28.89,
"text": "rarer, not because the crocodiles"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 28.89,
"t1": 30.82,
"text": "are different, because of warning"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 30.82,
"t1": 32.62,
"text": "signs, removal of problem"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 32.62,
"t1": 34.31,
"text": "animals, and people who know"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 34.31,
"t1": 35.27,
"text": "the rules."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.64,
"text": "For a while though, we"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 1.64,
"t1": 3.45,
"text": "were winning. After the Second"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 3.45,
"t1": 5.25,
"text": "World War, crocodile skin"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 5.25,
"t1": 6.8,
"text": "was worth a fortune."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 6.8,
"t1": 8.47,
"text": "Hunters shot them by the tens of"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 8.47,
"t1": 11.22,
"text": "thousands. By 1971,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 11.22,
"t1": 13.51,
"text": "in Australia's Northern Territory, about"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 13.51,
"t1": 15.47,
"text": "three thousand were left."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 15.47,
"t1": 17.75,
"text": "Then they were protected."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 17.75,
"t1": 20.47,
"text": "Today, there are around one hundred thousand."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 20.47,
"t1": 22.8,
"text": "The population has almost fully recovered,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 22.8,
"t1": 25.25,
"text": "and there are far more people living, fishing,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 25.25,
"t1": 26.89,
"text": "and swimming beside them."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 26.89,
"t1": 28.31,
"text": "The animal came back."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 28.31,
"t1": 30.0,
"text": "The rules for living next to it had to"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 30.0,
"t1": 30.93,
"text": "come back too"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.45,
"text": "There is another side to this animal."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 2.45,
"t1": 4.27,
"text": "A female builds a nest of mud"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 4.27,
"t1": 6.15,
"text": "and plants and lays around"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 6.15,
"t1": 7.87,
"text": "fifty eggs. The heat"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 7.87,
"t1": 9.51,
"text": "inside the nest decides"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 9.51,
"t1": 11.33,
"text": "whether each one becomes male or"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 11.33,
"t1": 13.13,
"text": "female. She guards it"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 13.13,
"t1": 14.75,
"text": "for about three months."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 14.75,
"t1": 16.58,
"text": "She barely leaves."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 16.58,
"t1": 18.78,
"text": "When the babies call from inside the eggs,"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 18.78,
"t1": 20.45,
"text": "she digs them out. Then"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 20.45,
"t1": 22.15,
"text": "she picks them up in the same jaws that"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 22.15,
"t1": 23.98,
"text": "can crush a skull and carries"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 23.98,
"t1": 25.87,
"text": "them gently to the water."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 25.87,
"t1": 27.56,
"text": "Even so, about one in a"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 27.56,
"t1": 29.45,
"text": "hundred lives to grow up."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 29.45,
"t1": 31.2,
"text": "The one watching you is that one"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 31.2,
"t1": 32.1,
"text": "in a hundred"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.62,
"text": "So here is what really happens"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 1.62,
"t1": 3.29,
"text": "when it sees you first."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 3.29,
"t1": 6.18,
"text": "It does not charge. It studies."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 6.18,
"t1": 8.56,
"text": "It watches how close you come to the water,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 8.56,
"t1": 10.27,
"text": "how long you stay, whether"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 10.27,
"t1": 12.05,
"text": "you come back. Rangers"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 12.05,
"t1": 13.91,
"text": "warn about this. Fill"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 13.91,
"t1": 15.75,
"text": "your bucket at the same spot each"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 15.75,
"t1": 17.4,
"text": "morning, and one morning it will"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 17.4,
"t1": 19.4,
"text": "be waiting at that spot."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 19.4,
"t1": 21.05,
"text": "Then it sinks. It comes"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 21.05,
"t1": 22.84,
"text": "in along the bottom where you cannot"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 22.84,
"t1": 24.62,
"text": "see it. It stops one"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 24.62,
"t1": 26.35,
"text": "body length away, and it"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 26.35,
"t1": 28.34,
"text": "waits for the moment you look down"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.64,
"text": "You survive a crocodile before"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 1.64,
"t1": 3.58,
"text": "you ever meet it. Stay"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 3.58,
"t1": 6.15,
"text": "five meters back from the water's edge."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 6.15,
"t1": 7.84,
"text": "Camp at least 50 meters from the"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 7.84,
"t1": 9.76,
"text": "water. Never use the same"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 9.76,
"t1": 11.53,
"text": "spot twice. And if a"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 11.53,
"t1": 13.64,
"text": "sign says crocodiles live here,"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 13.64,
"t1": 15.36,
"text": "believe the sign. Even if"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 15.36,
"t1": 17.8,
"text": "the water looks empty, especially"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 17.8,
"t1": 19.75,
"text": "if it looks empty. If the worst"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 19.75,
"t1": 22.02,
"text": "happens, do not play dead."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 22.02,
"t1": 24.25,
"text": "Fight. Go for the eyes."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 24.25,
"t1": 26.29,
"text": "Hit the snout. Make yourself"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 26.29,
"t1": 28.24,
"text": "more trouble than you are worth."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 28.24,
"t1": 30.22,
"text": "Survivors say the same thing."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 30.22,
"t1": 32.44,
"text": "It let go because they did not stop."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.8,
"text": "So you do the only smart thing"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 1.8,
"t1": 4.31,
"text": "left. You stop walking forward."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 4.31,
"t1": 6.07,
"text": "You back up, slowly, the"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 6.07,
"t1": 8.44,
"text": "way you came. Out of the water."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 8.44,
"t1": 10.53,
"text": "Up the bank. Five meters."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 10.53,
"t1": 12.45,
"text": "Ten. Behind you, the surface"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 12.45,
"t1": 14.35,
"text": "is flat again. Then"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 14.35,
"t1": 16.67,
"text": "two small bumps rise, exactly"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 16.67,
"t1": 18.49,
"text": "where you were standing. It was"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 18.49,
"t1": 20.33,
"text": "that close. You never felt"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 20.33,
"t1": 23.0,
"text": "a thing. It saw you first."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 23.0,
"t1": 25.24,
"text": "This time, you saw it second."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 25.24,
"t1": 26.8,
"text": "And that was just enough."
}
]